      "machineHash": "6847720f30a4684110fc9c237e3be729e53731c0dde20f2084260a78730db1c2",
      "machineText": "Pintasan global dibangun langsung di atas fasilitas native setiap platform dan tidak menambahkan dependensi pihak ketiga.",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Global shortcuts are built directly on each platform's native facilities and add no third party depe…",
